        If specified, the input tensor is cast to :attr:`dtype` before the operation
        is performed. This is useful for preventing data type overflows. Default: None.

Examples::
    >>> t = torch.ones(2, 2)
    >>> torch.special.softmax(t, 0)
    tensor([[0.5000, 0.5000],
            [0.5000, 0.5000]])

